"## English Wikipedia smoke test: According to the English Wikipedia article on 'Wikipedia', when was Wikipedia launched, who operates it, and how many articles does it contain (site:en.wikipedia.org)\n**Findings (per the English Wikipedia article \"Wikipedia,\" en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia):**\n\n1. **Launch date:** Wikipedia was launched on **January 15, 2001**, by Jimmy Wales and Larry Sanger, as a free, openly editable online encyclopedia. [1]\n\n2. **Operator:** It is hosted and operated by the **Wikimedia Foundation**, an American nonprofit organization. [1]\n\n3. **Article count:**\n   - **English Wikipedia** contains **over 7 million articles** (the 7-million milestone was passed in November 2024; the count rises continuously). [1][2]\n   - Across **all language editions**, Wikipedia contains **over 60 million articles** combined. [1]\n\n**Caveats:** Article counts are dynamic and change daily; figures above reflect the most recent widely reported milestones (2024–2025). The \"Wikipedia\" article itself notes these numbers as approximate, citing the live statistics page for current totals. [1][2]\n\n**Sources:**\n[1] English Wikipedia article \"Wikipedia\" — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia\n[2] Wikipedia statistics / Main Page — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:Statistics"